OL,3,A'Culture shift' needed in how UK does
OL,4,Abusiness, PM urges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK needs a "culture shift" in how
OL,7,Fit does business, Andy Burnham has said
OL,8,Fahead of a meeting with some of the
OL,9,FUK's biggest bosses.
OL,11,FThe prime minister said those who take
OL,12,Frisks in business should be backed by
OL,13,Fgovernment and local leaders should
OL,14,Fhave the power to work with businesses.
OL,16,FThe current Labour government has been
OL,17,Fcriticised for increasing costs for
OL,18,Fbusinesses, such as with the employer
OL,19,Fnational insurance and minimum wage
OL,20,Fchanges under Burnham's predecessor Sir
OL,21,FKeir Starmer.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
